    <div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;">Your Annual leave request was approved.</div>
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f1f5f9;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding:32px 12px;">
          <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="max-width:560px;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:24px 32px 8px 32px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2563eb;">Clasp Workspace</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:8px 32px 24px 32px;">
                <h1 style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;">Leave request approved</h1>
                <p style="margin:0 0 14px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">Hi Ada Lovelace,</p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 14px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">HR Lead approved your Annual leave request for 2026-11-12 to 2026-11-14.</p><p style="margin:0 0 14px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">Note from HR Lead: Enjoy the break.</p>
                <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin:18px 0;padding:12px 16px;background-color:#f8fafc;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;"><tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#64748b;font-size:14px;vertical-align:top;">Leave type</td><td style="padding:4px 0;color:#0f172a;font-size:14px;vertical-align:top;">Annual</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#64748b;font-size:14px;vertical-align:top;">Dates</td><td style="padding:4px 0;color:#0f172a;font-size:14px;vertical-align:top;">2026-11-12 to 2026-11-14</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#64748b;font-size:14px;vertical-align:top;">Status</td><td style="padding:4px 0;color:#0f172a;font-size:14px;vertical-align:top;">approved</td></tr></table>
                <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0 8px 0;"><tr><td style="border-radius:8px;background-color:#2563eb;"><a href="https://app.example.com/acme/leave/req1" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">View request</a></td></tr></table>
                
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:16px 32px 24px 32px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;">
                <div style="margin-bottom:4px;color:#475569;font-weight:600;">Acme</div>
                <div>Clasp Workspace &middot; Need help? <a href="mailto:support@claspworkspace.com" style="color:#2563eb;text-decoration:none;">support@claspworkspace.com</a></div>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>",
  "subject": "Your leave request was approved",
  "text": "Leave request approved

Hi Ada Lovelace,

HR Lead approved your Annual leave request for 2026-11-12 to 2026-11-14.

Note from HR Lead: Enjoy the break.

Leave type: Annual
Dates: 2026-11-12 to 2026-11-14
Status: approved

View request: https://app.example.com/acme/leave/req1

Acme
Clasp Workspace
Support: support@claspworkspace.com",
}
`;

