  </body>
</html>",
  "subject": "Alan Turing invited you to Acme",
  "text": "You're invited to Acme

Alan Turing invited you to join Acme as Team Lead.

This invitation expires on 2026-11-10.

Accept invitation: https://app.example.com/acme/invite/tok123

This invitation was sent to you by a workspace administrator. If you were not expecting it, you can ignore this email.

Acme
Clasp Workspace
